{"$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guitaripod/wwdc-sessions/master/schema/transcript.schema.json", "id": "wwdc2017-816", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2017/816", "wordCount": 1667, "segments": [{"start": 22.0, "text": "Imagine you're searching for"}, {"start": 23.0, "text": "an apartment."}, {"start": 24.0, "text": "You've been on the hunt and this"}, {"start": 25.0, "text": "one looks pretty good."}, {"start": 27.0, "text": "The price is right."}, {"start": 28.0, "text": "The photos show tons of natural"}, {"start": 30.0, "text": "light. It's close to work."}, {"start": 32.0, "text": "So you schedule some time to"}, {"start": 34.0, "text": "stop by and check the place out."}, {"start": 37.0, "text": "You bike over. Someone buzzes you in."}, {"start": 39.0, "text": "You find the apartment door."}, {"start": 40.0, "text": "You give it a knock and the"}, {"start": 43.0, "text": "landlord greets you."}, {"start": 45.0, "text": "And before he'll even let you"}, {"start": 47.0, "text": "pass the front door, he has some"}, {"start": 48.0, "text": "requirements."}, {"start": 50.0, "text": "He wants to see a passport, a"}, {"start": 51.0, "text": "birth certificate, and your last"}, {"start": 53.0, "text": "four paystubs."}, {"start": 54.0, "text": "Now this would be a little"}, {"start": 55.0, "text": "ridiculous, right?"}, {"start": 57.0, "text": "You just want to check the place"}, {"start": 58.0, "text": "out. You're not ready to commit to"}, {"start": 59.0, "text": "anything yet plus who knows if"}, {"start": 61.0, "text": "you're private info's safe with"}, {"start": 63.0, "text": "this guy?"}, {"start": 65.0, "text": "First impressions matter."}, {"start": 68.0, "text": "They matter because they could"}, {"start": 69.0, "text": "also be your last."}, {"start": 71.0, "text": "People have access to millions"}, {"start": 72.0, "text": "of apps in the App Store."}, {"start": 74.0, "text": "You've already passed the first"}, {"start": 75.0, "text": "hurdle when someone installs"}, {"start": 76.0, "text": "your app."}, {"start": 77.0, "text": "Great. So prevent them from"}, {"start": 81.0, "text": "backing out and deleting your"}, {"start": 82.0, "text": "app in the same way you'd"}, {"start": 84.0, "text": "probably be off to the next"}, {"start": 85.0, "text": "apartment on your list."}, {"start": 86.0, "text": "And then instead, start things"}, {"start": 87.0, "text": "off with a great first"}, {"start": 88.0, "text": "impression."}, {"start": 93.0, "text": "Now suppose you're planning a"}, {"start": 94.0, "text": "trip and a friend suggested this"}, {"start": 96.0, "text": "travel app here."}, {"start": 98.0, "text": "Looks pretty good."}, {"start": 99.0, "text": "So the installation completes."}, {"start": 101.0, "text": "You tap open for the first time"}, {"start": 104.0, "text": "and you're met with this."}, {"start": 106.0, "text": "Now does this look familiar?"}, {"start": 108.0, "text": "Someone wants you to register"}, {"start": 110.0, "text": "here but there's not much info"}, {"start": 111.0, "text": "about what this app actually"}, {"start": 113.0, "text": "does."}, {"start": 114.0, "text": "And sure you have some idea"}, {"start": 115.0, "text": "after your friend's"}, {"start": 116.0, "text": "recommendation but when you open"}, {"start": 118.0, "text": "the app for the first time and"}, {"start": 120.0, "text": "this is how you're greeted, it"}, {"start": 122.0, "text": "still feels a little something"}, {"start": 123.0, "text": "like this guy."}, {"start": 127.0, "text": "There's a chance you might back"}, {"start": 128.0, "text": "out, delete it, and go find"}, {"start": 130.0, "text": "something else."}, {"start": 132.0, "text": "Now consider this military base"}, {"start": 136.0, "text": "with its fortified exterior."}, {"start": 138.0, "text": "The message to anyone on the"}, {"start": 139.0, "text": "outside is clear."}, {"start": 140.0, "text": "Stay out. Right?"}, {"start": 142.0, "text": "Compare that to Apple Union"}, {"start": 143.0, "text": "Square in San Francisco."}, {"start": 145.0, "text": "The entire front of the store"}, {"start": 146.0, "text": "opens up to the sidewalk invited"}, {"start": 148.0, "text": "passersby to wonder in."}, {"start": 151.0, "text": "And wondering is exactly what"}, {"start": 152.0, "text": "they do because people use -- as"}, {"start": 154.0, "text": "people explore the store,"}, {"start": 156.0, "text": "they're able to pick up and use"}, {"start": 157.0, "text": "iPhones."}, {"start": 158.0, "text": "They might not take a new Mac"}, {"start": 159.0, "text": "for a test drive or try on an"}, {"start": 160.0, "text": "Apple Watch."}, {"start": 161.0, "text": "All without obstacles or"}, {"start": 163.0, "text": "friction."}, {"start": 164.0, "text": "Your first launch experience"}, {"start": 166.0, "text": "should feel just as"}, {"start": 167.0, "text": "frictionless."}, {"start": 168.0, "text": "If people are greeted with an"}, {"start": 169.0, "text": "open, interactive experience,"}, {"start": 171.0, "text": "the very first time they tap"}, {"start": 173.0, "text": "your icon, you're going to make"}, {"start": 174.0, "text": "a great first impression and"}, {"start": 175.0, "text": "keep them coming back."}, {"start": 177.0, "text": "So let's talk about some ways to"}, {"start": 178.0, "text": "make that happen."}, {"start": 181.0, "text": "We'll be discussing some tips"}, {"start": 182.0, "text": "for leading with content first."}, {"start": 185.0, "text": "How to teach new users about"}, {"start": 187.0, "text": "your app through interaction."}, {"start": 190.0, "text": "And when you need to ask for"}, {"start": 191.0, "text": "some more information upfront,"}, {"start": 193.0, "text": "some tips on timing that will"}, {"start": 196.0, "text": "add to a great user experience."}, {"start": 198.0, "text": "So let's start with some"}, {"start": 199.0, "text": "strategies with a content first"}, {"start": 201.0, "text": "approach."}, {"start": 202.0, "text": "Let's compare our travel app to"}, {"start": 206.0, "text": "another travel app."}, {"start": 207.0, "text": "Now this is Jetsetter."}, {"start": 209.0, "text": "And the very first time you open"}, {"start": 211.0, "text": "Jetsetter you're immediately"}, {"start": 212.0, "text": "greeted with this great content."}, {"start": 215.0, "text": "Big beautiful images."}, {"start": 216.0, "text": "Useful information."}, {"start": 218.0, "text": "You can browse this feed, of"}, {"start": 219.0, "text": "course, or you can jump right"}, {"start": 220.0, "text": "into search if you have"}, {"start": 221.0, "text": "something specific in mind."}, {"start": 223.0, "text": "If a destination catches your"}, {"start": 225.0, "text": "attention, you can drill in for"}, {"start": 226.0, "text": "more photos and more details."}, {"start": 230.0, "text": "And it's been seconds since you"}, {"start": 232.0, "text": "first launched this app and"}, {"start": 233.0, "text": "you're already using it like a"}, {"start": 234.0, "text": "pro."}, {"start": 235.0, "text": "You're intrigued by all this"}, {"start": 236.0, "text": "great content and you've already"}, {"start": 237.0, "text": "started daydreaming about laying"}, {"start": 239.0, "text": "on this beach."}, {"start": 240.0, "text": "It's only when you're ready to"}, {"start": 241.0, "text": "book the trip that you're"}, {"start": 243.0, "text": "prompted to register."}, {"start": 245.0, "text": "By now, you've got a good idea"}, {"start": 246.0, "text": "of what the app has to offer."}, {"start": 248.0, "text": "You've seen the potential"}, {"start": 249.0, "text": "benefits of registering."}, {"start": 250.0, "text": "So this feels like a more"}, {"start": 252.0, "text": "appropriate time to share more"}, {"start": 253.0, "text": "details."}, {"start": 257.0, "text": "If you're not convinced yet,"}, {"start": 258.0, "text": "just compare Jetsetter with our"}, {"start": 260.0, "text": "other travel app."}, {"start": 262.0, "text": "Now we've all been through some"}, {"start": 264.0, "text": "version of that top row."}, {"start": 265.0, "text": "Which one of these feels more"}, {"start": 266.0, "text": "welcoming to you?"}, {"start": 271.0, "text": "Always lead with great content."}, {"start": 273.0, "text": "Show off what makes your app"}, {"start": 274.0, "text": "great right off the bat and let"}, {"start": 276.0, "text": "people dig in."}, {"start": 279.0, "text": "Now there are some situations"}, {"start": 281.0, "text": "where a little bit of upfront"}, {"start": 282.0, "text": "instruction might be helpful."}, {"start": 284.0, "text": "And I say might because before"}, {"start": 286.0, "text": "you start incorporating some of"}, {"start": 287.0, "text": "the tips we're about to look at,"}, {"start": 289.0, "text": "I want you to very carefully"}, {"start": 290.0, "text": "consider whether any upfront"}, {"start": 291.0, "text": "instruction is needed at all."}, {"start": 293.0, "text": "Let's take a quick look at the"}, {"start": 295.0, "text": "phone app."}, {"start": 296.0, "text": "Now just imagine if we designed"}, {"start": 298.0, "text": "this with a series of first run"}, {"start": 300.0, "text": "tool tips."}, {"start": 302.0, "text": "It'll be a little ridiculous,"}, {"start": 303.0, "text": "right?"}, {"start": 305.0, "text": "This interface is obvious."}, {"start": 307.0, "text": "We know how it works."}, {"start": 309.0, "text": "You should strive to design your"}, {"start": 310.0, "text": "interfaces to be as intuitive"}, {"start": 312.0, "text": "and as easy to understand as"}, {"start": 313.0, "text": "possible."}, {"start": 314.0, "text": "Ideally no upfront instruction"}, {"start": 316.0, "text": "is needed at all."}, {"start": 317.0, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 318.0, "text": "Let's take a look at Lara Croft"}, {"start": 321.0, "text": "GO."}, {"start": 322.0, "text": "This is your starting point"}, {"start": 324.0, "text": "here. No onboarding."}, {"start": 325.0, "text": "No instructions."}, {"start": 327.0, "text": "Nothing to pull your attention"}, {"start": 328.0, "text": "from this immersive experience."}, {"start": 330.0, "text": "You're right in the game but you"}, {"start": 332.0, "text": "still need to learn how to play"}, {"start": 333.0, "text": "this game."}, {"start": 334.0, "text": "So these first two levels are"}, {"start": 335.0, "text": "designed to introduce you to the"}, {"start": 336.0, "text": "basics."}, {"start": 339.0, "text": "Well, you only have a straight"}, {"start": 340.0, "text": "line here and Lara looks like"}, {"start": 342.0, "text": "she's ready to go."}, {"start": 343.0, "text": "Since there are no visible"}, {"start": 344.0, "text": "controls, you try swiping on the"}, {"start": 346.0, "text": "screen."}, {"start": 347.0, "text": "And sure enough, she starts"}, {"start": 349.0, "text": "moving in the direction you've"}, {"start": 350.0, "text": "gestured."}, {"start": 354.0, "text": "You quickly discover you can"}, {"start": 355.0, "text": "move up and down walls too."}, {"start": 356.0, "text": "And congratulations, you've"}, {"start": 358.0, "text": "learned the game's navigation"}, {"start": 360.0, "text": "controls."}, {"start": 362.0, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 363.0, "text": "Now you've got this glowing tile"}, {"start": 364.0, "text": "up ahead catching your"}, {"start": 365.0, "text": "attention."}, {"start": 366.0, "text": "Options look pretty limited so"}, {"start": 368.0, "text": "let's go check it out."}, {"start": 373.0, "text": "Yes, you've just completed a"}, {"start": 375.0, "text": "level."}, {"start": 376.0, "text": "Now that one was pretty simple,"}, {"start": 381.0, "text": "of course, but it's teaching you"}, {"start": 386.0, "text": "the basics and you're already"}, {"start": 388.0, "text": "playing the game."}, {"start": 390.0, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 392.0, "text": "Level 2 starts here."}, {"start": 393.0, "text": "It looks like your path is cut"}, {"start": 395.0, "text": "short. So let's try that switch."}, {"start": 403.0, "text": "Ah ha, the missing path fills in"}, {"start": 405.0, "text": "and you've figured out another"}, {"start": 407.0, "text": "important part about how this"}, {"start": 408.0, "text": "game works."}, {"start": 409.0, "text": "You know, of course, things get"}, {"start": 413.0, "text": "a lot more complex from here."}, {"start": 415.0, "text": "But you can start to see how"}, {"start": 416.0, "text": "instruction can be layered into"}, {"start": 417.0, "text": "an experience."}, {"start": 419.0, "text": "And again, no onboarding."}, {"start": 420.0, "text": "No tool tips or floating hands"}, {"start": 422.0, "text": "here. There are no barriers when you"}, {"start": 424.0, "text": "first play Lara Croft GO."}, {"start": 426.0, "text": "This approach works in all kinds"}, {"start": 427.0, "text": "of apps not just games."}, {"start": 429.0, "text": "This is Streaks."}, {"start": 432.0, "text": "It's a simple app designed to"}, {"start": 433.0, "text": "help you pick up new habits."}, {"start": 435.0, "text": "In my case as you might be able"}, {"start": 437.0, "text": "to guess I'm studying French and"}, {"start": 439.0, "text": "I'm trying to make a habit of"}, {"start": 440.0, "text": "practicing every day."}, {"start": 441.0, "text": "Maybe Streaks can help."}, {"start": 443.0, "text": "The completion of a task is"}, {"start": 445.0, "text": "represented by the filling in of"}, {"start": 446.0, "text": "a ring."}, {"start": 447.0, "text": "So the first launch experience"}, {"start": 449.0, "text": "conveys this in a clever way by"}, {"start": 451.0, "text": "inviting you to fill in rings as"}, {"start": 452.0, "text": "you proceed through this"}, {"start": 453.0, "text": "introduction."}, {"start": 455.0, "text": "And you're led right into"}, {"start": 457.0, "text": "creating your first habit."}, {"start": 459.0, "text": "So if your app requires a bit of"}, {"start": 461.0, "text": "upfront education, it's going to"}, {"start": 463.0, "text": "be a lot more compelling if it's"}, {"start": 464.0, "text": "interactive and gives people"}, {"start": 466.0, "text": "that sense of jumping right in."}, {"start": 471.0, "text": "Teach through interactive"}, {"start": 472.0, "text": "experiences."}, {"start": 473.0, "text": "Now another place you don't want"}, {"start": 477.0, "text": "people to get stuck is with"}, {"start": 478.0, "text": "permission requests."}, {"start": 479.0, "text": "And you know what it's like to"}, {"start": 480.0, "text": "open an app for the first time"}, {"start": 482.0, "text": "and get hit with permission"}, {"start": 483.0, "text": "request after permission request."}, {"start": 484.0, "text": "Sort of like that demanding"}, {"start": 485.0, "text": "landlord we met earlier."}, {"start": 487.0, "text": "So let's look at some tips for"}, {"start": 488.0, "text": "getting this right."}, {"start": 490.0, "text": "This is Strava."}, {"start": 493.0, "text": "Strava lets you use your iPhone"}, {"start": 495.0, "text": "to track outdoor runs and bike"}, {"start": 497.0, "text": "rides."}, {"start": 498.0, "text": "And it eventually asks for"}, {"start": 499.0, "text": "access to your location, your"}, {"start": 501.0, "text": "camera, your context, even"}, {"start": 503.0, "text": "HealthKit data but it doesn't"}, {"start": 505.0, "text": "ask for all of these right away."}, {"start": 507.0, "text": "Instead, Strava makes requests"}, {"start": 509.0, "text": "on an as needed basis."}, {"start": 512.0, "text": "For example, it's not until"}, {"start": 513.0, "text": "you're ready to take Strava out"}, {"start": 515.0, "text": "for a ride for the first time"}, {"start": 516.0, "text": "that you're prompted to share"}, {"start": 517.0, "text": "your location."}, {"start": 519.0, "text": "So you hit record down on the"}, {"start": 520.0, "text": "bottom."}, {"start": 521.0, "text": "We'll get you on a ride here."}, {"start": 523.0, "text": "Who's ready to roll?"}, {"start": 525.0, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 528.0, "text": "So you get on ride and"}, {"start": 530.0, "text": "eventually a little while later,"}, {"start": 532.0, "text": "you're ready to wrap things up."}, {"start": 533.0, "text": "We'll make it a short ride."}, {"start": 536.0, "text": "So you stop the ride and you tap"}, {"start": 538.0, "text": "save."}, {"start": 539.0, "text": "Now when you're saving a ride,"}, {"start": 541.0, "text": "you have the option to add more"}, {"start": 542.0, "text": "details including a photo."}, {"start": 548.0, "text": "And it's only when you tap add a"}, {"start": 550.0, "text": "photo that you're prompted for"}, {"start": 551.0, "text": "access to your photo library."}, {"start": 552.0, "text": "And this is another great"}, {"start": 555.0, "text": "example of a permission request"}, {"start": 557.0, "text": "that's right in context."}, {"start": 559.0, "text": "So you immediately see the"}, {"start": 560.0, "text": "benefit and no additional"}, {"start": 561.0, "text": "explanation is necessary."}, {"start": 565.0, "text": "And it's the same situation when"}, {"start": 566.0, "text": "looking for friends on Strava in"}, {"start": 568.0, "text": "your contacts."}, {"start": 571.0, "text": "The app requests permissions on"}, {"start": 572.0, "text": "a need to know basis."}, {"start": 574.0, "text": "So you retain a sense of control"}, {"start": 576.0, "text": "over both the experience and"}, {"start": 577.0, "text": "your private data."}, {"start": 582.0, "text": "Now there are a few apps out"}, {"start": 583.0, "text": "there that can't offer any value"}, {"start": 585.0, "text": "without some sort of"}, {"start": 586.0, "text": "permissions."}, {"start": 587.0, "text": "This is Transit."}, {"start": 589.0, "text": "It lists departures of nearby"}, {"start": 590.0, "text": "buses and trains ordered based"}, {"start": 592.0, "text": "on proximity to your current"}, {"start": 593.0, "text": "location."}, {"start": 594.0, "text": "I live in San Francisco and I"}, {"start": 596.0, "text": "use this one all the time to get"}, {"start": 597.0, "text": "around."}, {"start": 599.0, "text": "Of course it wouldn't be able to"}, {"start": 600.0, "text": "provide this data without your"}, {"start": 602.0, "text": "location."}, {"start": 603.0, "text": "So the first time you launch the"}, {"start": 605.0, "text": "app, you are prompted to share"}, {"start": 607.0, "text": "your location."}, {"start": 608.0, "text": "And as soon as you tap allow,"}, {"start": 610.0, "text": "the map zooms in and you're"}, {"start": 612.0, "text": "presented with a list of nearby"}, {"start": 613.0, "text": "routes and departure times."}, {"start": 615.0, "text": "So you immediately see the value"}, {"start": 617.0, "text": "Transit will provide in exchange"}, {"start": 619.0, "text": "for this information."}, {"start": 621.0, "text": "So remember, ensure people"}, {"start": 626.0, "text": "understand the value of sharing"}, {"start": 628.0, "text": "their private data with you"}, {"start": 629.0, "text": "ideally before you ask for it."}, {"start": 632.0, "text": "Once that permission has been"}, {"start": 633.0, "text": "granted, reinforce the decision"}, {"start": 635.0, "text": "by showing off the benefits"}, {"start": 636.0, "text": "you'll provide with that data."}, {"start": 639.0, "text": "Only ask for what's needed when"}, {"start": 640.0, "text": "it's needed."}, {"start": 643.0, "text": "Follow these tips and I promise"}, {"start": 645.0, "text": "you'll make a great first impression."}]}
